{"2567050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Orb Of The Watcher", "steam_appid": 2567050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567050/extras/06c6f552f1a36e2375f505b39a6c2b8d.avif?t=1758920336\" width=790 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive and thrilling role-playing game adventure in the style of those much-loved adventure classics from the days of the 386 processor. The game will transport players into a captivating fantasy world filled with mystical creatures, formidable challenges, and epic stories. Embrace your destiny and embark on a journey like no other as you explore the depths of Waterdeep to unravel ancient secrets and find the infamous Orb Of The Watcher. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the old RPG adventures of the nineties but updated for the modern audience while still keeping the old look and feel. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels of action! Explore the sewers under Waterdeep and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash Your Inner Hero: Prepare to discover what lies beneath Waterdeep as you embark on an epic quest to get rich. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth Mystical Wonders: Engage in breathtaking skirmishes, uncover forgotten artifacts, and explore the vast tunnels that snake under the city.. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge Unbreakable Alliances: Assemble a party of heroes, each with unique abilities, and strategically combine your strengths to overcome any obstacle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with fifth edition. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Embark on this journey and become a legend today!</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s